，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["yululu-q-516a6deca6b34859bb81"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"atlas-close-q-wu-date","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-7e623d5c0070fc0c04d7","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：天纪四年（公元 280）。","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":529,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ce3554cdfa6d4a10d8dc","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"atlas-close-q-wu-letter","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-494ea68636e86f3566e3","layer":"original","quote":"而王濬顺流将至，司马伷、王浑皆临近境。皓用光禄勋薛莹、中书令胡冲等计〖7〗，分遣使，奉书于濬、伷、浑曰：“昔汉室失统，九州分裂；先人因时，略有江南；遂分阻山川，与魏乖隔。今大晋龙兴，德覆四海；暗劣偷安，未喻天命。至于今者，猥烦六军；衡盖路次〖8〗，远临江渚。举国震惶，假息漏刻〖9〗；敢缘天朝，含弘光大。谨遣私署太常张夔等〖10〗，奉所佩印绶，委质请命。惟垂信纳，以济元元〖11〗。”﹝三﹞","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":523,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":195,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"atlas-close-q-wu-surrender","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-c76b27d961ba7e5c15ed","layer":"original","quote":"（壬申）〔三月壬寅〕〖12〗，王濬最先到；于是受皓之降，解缚焚榇〖13〗，延请相见。﹝四﹞","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":524,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"atlas-close-q-wu-year","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-6d9d569aba82d35ae0c8","layer":"original","quote":"四年春〖1〗，立中山、代等十一王〖2〗。大赦。","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":520,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-e-o076a-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-11441c73cfeb9b85407b","layer":"original","quote":"闻武昌左部督薛莹，征下狱〖1〗，抗上疏曰：“夫俊乂者〖2〗，国家之良宝，社稷之贵资；庶政所以伦叙〖3〗，四门所以穆清也〖4〗。故大司农楼玄、散骑中常侍王蕃、少府李勖〖5〗，皆当世秀颖，一时显器；既蒙初宠，从容列位〖6〗；而并旋受诛殛，或圮族替祀〖7〗，或投弃荒裔。盖《周礼》有赦贤之辟〖8〗，《春秋》有宥善之义〖9〗。《书》曰：‘与其杀不辜〖10〗，宁失不经〖11〗。’而蕃等罪名未定，大辟已加〖12〗；心经忠义，身被极刑：岂不痛哉！且已死之刑〖13〗，固无所识〖14〗；至乃焚烁流漂，弃之水滨：惧非先王之正典，或甫侯之所戒也〖15〗。是以百姓哀耸，士民同戚。蕃、勖永已，悔亦靡及〖16〗；诚望陛下，赦召玄出。而顷闻薛莹，猝见逮录〖17〗。莹父综，纳言先帝〖18〗，傅弼文皇〖19〗。及莹承基，内厉名行；今之所坐〖20〗，罪在可宥。臣惧有司，未详其事；如复诛戮，益失民望。乞垂天恩，原赦莹罪；哀矜庶狱〖21〗，清澄刑网〖22〗。则天下幸甚！”","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":378,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":421,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-o076","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-11441c73cfeb9b85407b","layer":"original","quote":"闻武昌左部督薛莹，征下狱〖1〗，抗上疏曰：“夫俊乂者〖2〗，国家之良宝，社稷之贵资；庶政所以伦叙〖3〗，四门所以穆清也〖4〗。故大司农楼玄、散骑中常侍王蕃、少府李勖〖5〗，皆当世秀颖，一时显器；既蒙初宠，从容列位〖6〗；而并旋受诛殛，或圮族替祀〖7〗，或投弃荒裔。盖《周礼》有赦贤之辟〖8〗，《春秋》有宥善之义〖9〗。《书》曰：‘与其杀不辜〖10〗，宁失不经〖11〗。’而蕃等罪名未定，大辟已加〖12〗；心经忠义，身被极刑：岂不痛哉！且已死之刑〖13〗，固无所识〖14〗；至乃焚烁流漂，弃之水滨：惧非先王之正典，或甫侯之所戒也〖15〗。是以百姓哀耸，士民同戚。蕃、勖永已，悔亦靡及〖16〗；诚望陛下，赦召玄出。而顷闻薛莹，猝见逮录〖17〗。莹父综，纳言先帝〖18〗，傅弼文皇〖19〗。及莹承基，内厉名行；今之所坐〖20〗，罪在可宥。臣惧有司，未详其事；如复诛戮，益失民望。乞垂天恩，原赦莹罪；哀矜庶狱〖21〗，清澄刑网〖22〗。则天下幸甚！”","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":378,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":421,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"major-proof-q-wu-letter","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-2039c8cd73aadf4de2e9","layer":"original","quote":"天纪四年，晋军征皓；皓奉书于司马伷、王浑、王濬请降：其文，莹所造也。","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":44,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"major-proof-q-xueying-identity","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-79adb2c84bd62d3b6a9d","layer":"original","quote":"出为武昌左部督〖2〗。后定被诛，皓追圣溪事，下莹狱，徙广州〖3〗。","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":330,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":40,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"panlu-q-9c803300aa82314d1ecc","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-868322f07629aeb01c40","layer":"original","quote":"姚信、楼玄、贺邵、张悌、郭逴、薛莹、滕修及族弟喜、抗，或清白忠勤，或姿才卓茂〖6〗；皆社稷之桢干〖7〗，国家之良辅；愿陛下重留神思，访以时务：各尽其忠，拾遗万一","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":70,"end":150,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-5e1ac8597c6e78a9cfc7","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-c76b27d961ba7e5c15ed","layer":"original","quote":"（壬申）〔三月壬寅〕〖12〗，王濬最先到；于是受皓之降，解缚焚榇〖13〗，延请相见","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":524,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-e4e74308393a35a22bc8","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-494ea68636e86f3566e3","layer":"original","quote":"而王濬顺流将至，司马伷、王浑皆临近境。皓用光禄勋薛莹、中书令胡冲等计〖7〗，分遣使，奉书于濬、伷、浑曰：“昔汉室失统，九州分裂；先人因时，略有江南；遂分阻山川，与魏乖隔。今大晋龙兴，德覆四海；暗劣偷安，未喻天命。至于今者，猥烦六军；衡盖路次〖8〗，远临江渚。举国震惶，假息漏刻〖9〗；敢缘天朝，含弘光大。谨遣私署太常张夔等〖10〗，奉所佩印绶，委质请命","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":523,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":176,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-f5269488534fa132d3ed","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-6b23919e6e7e84f46e2b","layer":"pei","quote":"《吴录》曰：“晋武帝问薛莹吴之名臣，莹对称彝‘有忠贞之节’。”","attribution":"裴注·吴录","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":480,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-b475df96e2d83156c86f","start":0,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-341827cec2f744f90610","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-ebdb94c9270d31300148","layer":"original","quote":"贺邵字兴伯，会稽山阴人也〖1〗。﹝一﹞孙休即位，从中郎为散骑中常侍〖2〗。出为吴郡太守。","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-c23c889454159c94bf24","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-509f07a12985aedad2c9","layer":"original","quote":"孙休即位，与贺邵、薛莹、虞汜俱为散骑中常侍〖4〗；皆加驸马都尉〖5〗，时论清之〖6〗。遣使至蜀，蜀人称焉。还，为夏口监军〖7〗。","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-c8bb385e38b09ed3ddca","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-2e2c250fcae3ce252cbe","layer":"original","quote":"孙亮即位，诸葛恪辅政；表曜为太史令，撰《吴书》〖1〗，华覈、薛莹等皆与参同。","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":252,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-0afdb7821a1aca8855a0","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-d802ad7948c75961a8e4","layer":"original","quote":"永安初，从选曹郎为散骑中常侍","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-516a6deca6b34859bb81","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-97d739059bba97722b70","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《会稽典录》曰：“汜，字世洪。生南海，年十六，父卒，还乡里。孙綝废幼主，迎立琅邪王休。休未至，綝欲入宫，图为不轨；召百官会议，皆惶怖失色，徒唯唯而已。汜对曰：‘明公为国伊、周，处将相之位，擅废立之威；将上安宗庙，下惠百姓，大小踊跃，自以伊、霍复见。今迎王未至，而欲入宫；如是，群下摇荡，众听疑惑：非所以永终忠孝，扬名后世也。’綝不怿，竟立休。休初即位，汜与贺邵、王蕃、薛莹俱为散骑中常侍。以讨扶严功，拜交州刺史，冠军将军，余姚侯。寻卒。”","attribution":"裴注·会稽典录","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2bf6738d5adf6a51cccd","start":0,"end":222,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-57f757984493adb40016","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-97d739059bba97722b70","layer":"pei","quote":"休初即位，汜与贺邵、王蕃、薛莹俱为散骑中常侍","attribution":"裴注·《会稽典录》","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2bf6738d5adf6a51cccd","start":174,"end":196,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-c266c92f4ae16f57e3cc","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-f45dd121de51681a7018","layer":"original","quote":"周昭者，字恭远。与韦曜、薛莹、华覈并述《吴书》〖43〗。后为中书郎，坐事下狱。覈表救之，孙休不听，遂伏法云","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":473,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-082f2bc2bca1364edb2a","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-2039c8cd73aadf4de2e9","layer":"original","quote":"是时法政多谬，举措烦苛；莹每上便宜〖20〗，陈缓刑简役，以济育百姓：事或施行。迁光禄勋。天纪四年，晋军征皓；皓奉书于司马伷、王浑、王濬请降：其文，莹所造也。","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-118dd7b542a20ec2838a","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-54c13977d6aeab18cd97","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：张纮文理意正，为世令器〖1〗；孙策待之，亚于张昭；诚有以也〖2〗。严、程、阚生，一时儒林也。至畯辞荣济旧〖3〗，不亦长者乎〖4〗？薛综学识规纳〖5〗，为吴良臣。及莹纂蹈〖6〗，允有先风〖7〗；然于暴酷之朝，屡登显列〖8〗：君子殆诸〖9〗。","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":363,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":122,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-134b23ea75ef3c141357","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-79adb2c84bd62d3b6a9d","layer":"original","quote":"出为武昌左部督","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":330,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":40,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-1fa79dff259bf6557758","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-606cc23ede6891780b6d","layer":"original","quote":"数年，以病去官","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":282,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":56,"end":63,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-3a72e0f14bf9e45791ea","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-606cc23ede6891780b6d","layer":"original","quote":"孙休即位，为散骑中常侍","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":282,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":44,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-40bf6de24d041e4401b4","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-dc3086d598da73dd21b7","layer":"original","quote":"建衡三年，皓追叹莹父综遗文，且命莹继作。莹献诗曰：","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":283,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-47dda975d0b64d3908d7","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-de816aa06830642c46b2","layer":"pei","quote":"武帝从容问莹曰：‘孙皓之所以亡者何也？’莹对曰：‘归命侯臣皓之君吴也，昵近小人，刑罚妄加；大臣大将，无所亲信；人人忧恐，各不自保。危亡之衅，实由于此。’帝遂问吴士存亡者之贤愚，莹各以状对。","attribution":"裴注·晋纪","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":361,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c8afa7e835f727d8b484","start":12,"end":106,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-4e0c1a280ed2f1e246b8","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-9a6639e15be118d15555","layer":"original","quote":"著书八篇，名曰《新议》","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":336,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":7,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-63355989643c76800a85","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-79adb2c84bd62d3b6a9d","layer":"original","quote":"后定被诛，皓追圣溪事，下莹狱，徙广州","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":330,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":51,"end":69,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-6405fb749a2f9c78d824","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-606cc23ede6891780b6d","layer":"original","quote":"及立太子，又领少傅","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":282,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":82,"end":91,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-781c6f826f9e7273a3fe","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-a72e44258789ea88860c","layer":"original","quote":"因过诣莹〖18〗，复为人所白〖19〗，云：“祎不惧罪，多将宾客会聚莹许。”乃收祎下狱，徙桂阳；莹，还广州","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":333,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":56,"end":108,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-ac160f2f80c14c368f35","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-9a6639e15be118d15555","layer":"original","quote":"太康三年，卒","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":336,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":6,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-ac4429f9468e6618da6f","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-606cc23ede6891780b6d","layer":"original","quote":"迁选曹尚书","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":282,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":76,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-b250f8ad7d8c86baf705","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-79adb2c84bd62d3b6a9d","layer":"original","quote":"皓令莹督万人往，遂以多磐石，难施功，罢还","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":330,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":19,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-b86fc7f04034d2681027","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-2039c8cd73aadf4de2e9","layer":"original","quote":"皓奉书于司马伷、王浑、王濬请降：其文，莹所造也","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":54,"end":77,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-ba2a0403be17fdc1d225","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-87bc0413c09c4df6d1f4","layer":"original","quote":"惟臣之先，昔仕于汉；奕世绵绵，颇涉台观〖4〗。暨臣父综〖5〗，遭时之难，卯金失御〖6〗，邦家毁乱。适兹乐土〖7〗，庶存孑遗〖8〗；天启其心，东南是归。厥初流隶，困于蛮垂〖9〗；大皇开基〖10〗，恩德远施。特蒙招命，拯擢泥污〖11〗；释放巾褐〖12〗，受职剖符〖13〗。作守合浦，在海之隅；迁入京辇〖14〗，遂升机枢〖15〗。枯瘁更荣，绝统复纪；自微而显，非愿之始〖16〗。亦惟宠遇，心存足止〖17〗。重值文皇〖18〗，建号东宫〖19〗；乃作少傅，光华益隆。明明圣嗣〖20〗，至德谦崇；礼遇兼加，惟渥惟丰〖21〗。哀哀先臣〖22〗，念竭其忠；洪恩未报，委世以终〖23〗。嗟臣蔑贱〖24〗，惟昆及弟〖25〗；幸生幸育，托综遗体。过庭既训〖26〗，顽蔽难启。堂构弗克，志存耦耕〖27〗；岂悟圣朝，仁泽流盈。追录先臣，愍其无成；是济是拔〖28〗，被以殊荣。珝忝千里〖29〗，受命南征；旌旗备物，金革扬声〖30〗。及臣斯陋，实暗实微；既显前轨〖31〗，人物之机〖32〗；复傅东宫〖33〗，继世荷辉〖34〗；才不逮先〖35〗，是忝是违。乾德博好〖36〗，文雅是贵；追悼亡臣，冀存遗类。如何愚胤〖37〗，曾无仿佛〖38〗！瞻彼旧宠，顾此顽虚；孰能忍愧，臣实与居。夙夜反侧，克心自论；父子兄弟，累世蒙恩。死惟结草〖39〗，生誓投身〖40〗；虽则灰陨〖41〗，无报万分〖42〗！","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":284,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":580,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-cbe867769aaa5c53167a","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-a72e44258789ea88860c","layer":"original","quote":"未至，召莹还，复职","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":333,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":109,"end":118,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-ceecdf0ce0f57e1a0303","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-606cc23ede6891780b6d","layer":"original","quote":"子珝，官至威南将军〖1〗。征交阯还，道病死。﹝一﹞珝弟莹，字道言。初为秘府中书郎〖2〗。孙休即位，为散骑中常侍。数年，以病去官。孙皓初，为左执法〖3〗。迁选曹尚书。及立太子，又领少傅。","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":282,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-cf7834c9e87424c5e49f","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-606cc23ede6891780b6d","layer":"original","quote":"初为秘府中书郎","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":282,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":33,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-dc28dc6cb1ce788f446e","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-96db767f18fd2a3897ed","layer":"original","quote":"莹既至洛阳，特先见叙〖21〗，为散骑常侍；答问处当〖22〗，皆有条理","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":335,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-e5f74fffabd7ff2a3845","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-de816aa06830642c46b2","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞干宝《晋纪》曰：“武帝从容问莹曰：‘孙皓之所以亡者何也？’莹对曰：‘归命侯臣皓之君吴也，昵近小人，刑罚妄加；大臣大将，无所亲信；人人忧恐，各不自保。危亡之衅，实由于此。’帝遂问吴士存亡者之贤愚，莹各以状对。”","attribution":"裴注·干宝晋纪","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":361,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c8afa7e835f727d8b484","start":0,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-f00b9e714d18a122c8d9","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-2039c8cd73aadf4de2e9","layer":"original","quote":"是时法政多谬，举措烦苛；莹每上便宜〖20〗，陈缓刑简役，以济育百姓：事或施行。","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-f43ec94ce37b45f15afe","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-cb4ee4d1a55a9c8a4e7c","layer":"original","quote":"皓遂召莹还，为左国史","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":332,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":10,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-f82e1ddcefa1b74cf4be","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-606cc23ede6891780b6d","layer":"original","quote":"孙皓初，为左执法","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":282,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":64,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-fc094470e1856d734fa1","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-2039c8cd73aadf4de2e9","layer":"original","quote":"迁光禄勋","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":39,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
